000400 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  JULY 15, 1981.
000700
000800***********************************************************
000900**                                                       **
001000**    T A P O D E L T                                    **
001100**                                                       **
001200*D      THIS PROGRAM IS THE MAIN PROGRAM FOR AUTO        **
001300*D      PURCHASE ORDER DELETE.  THIS PROGRAM DETERMINES  **
001400*D      WHICH POs ARE ELIGIBLE FOR DELETION AND CALLS    **
001500*D      'SPOHIST' TO COPY THE PO INTO THE HISTORY DB     **
001600*D      AND THEN CALLS 'SDELTPO' TO DO THE ACTUAL PO     **
001700*D      DELETION.                                        **
001800**                                                       **
001900***********************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C DECEMBER 20, 1994    JEFF BUNGO  REQ 94-055, 6555
      *C   DO NOT MOVE THE PURCHASE ORDER TO HISTORY IF THAT
      *C   PURCHASE ORDER HAS A REQUISITION NUMBER THAT IS ON
      *C   AN EXISTING WORKORDER.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C FEBRUARY 14, 1995    JIM COFFMAN
      *C   CHANGED THE LOGIC TO HANDLE NON-RECEIVABLE P.O.
      *C   DELETIONS AS DANVILLE FOUND THAT MANY WERE NOT
      *C   GETTING PROPERLY CLEARED FROM THE SYSTEM.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C 17FEB1995   DAVE PLUM
      *C   ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C SEPTEMBER 1996
      *C   EXPANDED DATE FIELDS TO COMPLY WITH END-OF-CENTURY.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C 23JUN1997   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO SKIP INVOICE CHECKS FOR NON-PAYABLE
      *C   PURCHASE ORDERS (FOR FRANCHISED ITEMS).
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C 07NOV1997   CA YODER
      *C   CORRECTED Y2K LOGIC.  CALCULATIONS INVOLVING SUBTRACTION
      *C   FROM YEAR FIELDS NOT RIGHT; CHANGED PROGRAM TO SUBTRACT
      *C   FROM COMPLETE CCYY FIELD.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C 04AUG1998   CA YODER
      *C   CHANGED CONDITION FOR NON-PAYABLE INDICATOR.  NAPANEE
      *C   HAD SOME POS WITH GARBAGE DATA IN THIS FIELD, CAUSING
      *C   THE EDIT CHECKS TO BE SKIPPED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  04/02/2003    DCR  DAN RAUCH
      *C  DCR01 - ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  11/20/2003    BRUCE GEISER
      *C   COMMENTED OUT SOME INTERNAL ORDER LOCIC.
      *C   ADDED BACK CHANGES THAT WERE DELETED BY MISTAKE AS FOLLOWS:
      *C
      *C 24MAY1999   CA YODER    (RICK BABCOCK REQUEST)
      *C   ADDED LOGIC FOR NAPANEE TO MOVE PO TO HISTORY IF PO MEETS
      *C   ALL DELETION REQUIREMENTS EXCEPT PAID QTY DOES NOT EQUAL
      *C   DELIVERED QTY.  IF THIS IS THE CASE, MOVE PO TO HISTORY IF
      *C   PO IS OLDER THAN 01/1998.
      *C
      *C 02AUG2000   JE COFFMAN  (GILLES LEDUC REEUEST)
      *C   ADDED LOGIC FOR VALLEYFIELD TO DO ESSENTIALLY THE SAME
      *C   THING CATHY DID IN THE PREVIOUS REQUEST. IF QTY-PAID
      *C   IS ONLY FIELD NOT MATCHING AND THE ORDER IS FLAGGED
      *C   AS AN INTERNAL ORDER, LET IT MOVE TO HISTORY.
      *C
      *C   JAN 08, 2004   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PASS PARAMETER TO SDELTPO THAT THE ITEM
      *C   IS BEING MOVED TO HISTORY.
      *C
      ***********************************************************
